ormal": "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2933571707.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 0, "max": 10, "star_count": 0, "value": 0}, "tags": [], "title": "青之芦苇 第二季", "type": "tv", "uri": "douban://douban.com/tv/37317360", "vendor_count": 0, "vendor_icons": [], "year": "2026"}, {"card_subtitle": "2026 / 美国 / 动画 / 提图斯·维里沃 布莱恩·泰", "comment": "故事背景为近未来的洛杉矶，整座城市被“美食秩序”彻底掌控：顶级主厨的权势堪比黑帮大佬，餐厅就是各方势力的权力中心，为了拿下顶级餐厅的一席位，有人不惜突破底线，不同的烹饪理念更是分化出针锋相对的派系。", "episodes_info": "", "has_linewatch": false, "honor_infos": [], "id": "36937276", "interest": null, "photos": ["https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2936442203.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2936442202.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2936442180.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2935305957.jpg"], "pic": {"large": "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m_ratio_poster/public/p2936025067.jpg", "normal": "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2936025067.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 0, "max": 10, "star_count": 0, "value": 0}, "tags": [], "title": "极道寿司次郎！", "type": "tv", "uri": "douban://douban.com/tv/36937276", "vendor_count": 0, "vendor_icons": [], "year": "2026"}, {"card_subtitle": "2026 / 日本 / 动画 / 小平麻纪 / 新祐树 和气杏未", "comment": "东京卍会与天竺的抗争以惨烈的结局落下帷幕。\n在众人各自怀抱着悲伤走向未来之时，\n花垣武道对已死的稀咲铁太感到了敬畏。\n接着，听说了整个时空穿越经过的佐野万次郎做出了某个决定。\n结束战斗、告别过去的花垣武道，终于抵达了恋人橘日向依然存活的最佳未来。\n然而，在那里，却不见“他”的身影。\n三支队伍争夺霸权——\n在这个被称为 “三天时代” 的世界里，\n最后的复仇，就此开始！", "episodes_info": "", "has_linewatch": false, "honor_infos": [], "id": "36942777", "interest": null, "photos": [], "pic": {"large": "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m_ratio_poster/public/p2935216912.jpg", "normal": "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2935216912.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 0, "max": 10, "star_count": 0, "value": 0}, "tags": [], "title": "东京复仇者 三天战争篇", "type": "tv", "uri": "douban://douban.com/tv/36942777", "vendor_count": 0, "vendor_icons": [], "year": "2026"}, {"card_subtitle": "2026 / 日本 / 动画 / 山崎雄太 / 结川麻希 矢野妃菜喜", "comment": "公元1333年，为武士统治日本奠定基石的镰仓幕府，因其所信任的幕臣——足利尊氏的谋反而宣告灭亡。\n失去了一切、被推入绝望深渊的幕府正统继承人——北条时行，在自称为神的神官——诹访赖重的手中引导下，逃离了化为一片火海的镰仓……。\n在逃亡抵达的诹访之地，时行与值得信赖的伙伴结成了「逃少党」，并借由「逃跑」与「活下去」来克服重重苦难，逐渐磨练出作为率领大军之将领的实力。\n另一方面，在京都的尊氏其权力正稳步扩张，而在镰仓，以尊氏之弟——直义为首的新统治也正大受欢迎。\n在时代更迭的巨大浪潮中，时行夺回天下的这场捉迷藏，其结局将会走向何方——。", "episodes_info": "", "has_linewatch": false, "honor_infos": [], "id": "37066641", "interest": null, "photos": ["https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2931087244.jpg", "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2931087236.jpg", "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2931087235.jpg", "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2931087226.jpg"], "pic": {"large": "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/m_ratio_poster/public/p2931087016.jpg", "normal": "https://img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2931087016.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 453, "max": 10, "star_count": 4.0, "value": 7.7}, "tags": [], "title": "擅长逃跑的殿下 第二季", "type": "tv", "uri": "douban://douban.com/tv/37066641", "vendor_count": 0, "vendor_icons": [], "year": "2026"}, {"card_subtitle": "2026 / 美国 / 动作 动画 冒险 / 萨赫利·汗 艾舒·德万", "comment": "年轻的御土师帕薇，在得知自己是科拉之后的新任神通后，命运随之改变。遭到人类与灵界势力追捕的她，与失散多年的双胞胎姊妹踏上旅程，试图揭开自身神秘的身世，同时拯救因末日浩劫后建立、支撑文明存续的七净土。然而，在这个时代，神通已不再被视为救世主，而是毁灭世界的象征。", "episodes_info": "", "has_linewatch": false, "honor_infos": [], "id": "37242516", "interest": null, "photos": ["https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2935703983.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2934342100.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2934342099.jpg", "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m/public/p2934342098.jpg"], "pic": {"large": "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/m_ratio_poster/public/p2935697789.jpg", "normal": "https://img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2935697789.jpg"}, "rating": {"count": 0, "max": 10, "star_count": 0, "value": 0}, "tags": [], "title": "降世神通：七净土 第一季", "type": "tv", "uri": "douba